---
import { SITE_NAME } from '../lib/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Advertising disclosure — ${SITE_NAME}`} description="Our approach to clearly identified display advertising, editorial independence and useful travel reading experiences." path="/advertising/"><section class="container section-block"><div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">How this site is supported</p><h1>Advertising, clearly marked.</h1></div><div class="prose"><h2>Display advertising</h2><p>We may support the site through clearly labeled display advertisements. Advertising is optional and is only loaded when a provider is configured and the required consent is in place. No advertising account or earnings are implied by this disclosure.</p><h2>Editorial independence</h2><p>An advertisement is not a recommendation from the editorial team. Advertisers do not determine our transport comparisons, source references or factual corrections. Any future sponsored work or affiliate relationship will be identified where it appears.</p><h2>Reading comes first</h2><p>We do not use full-page click interception or advertising windows triggered by navigation. Ads must be distinguishable from guide links, route choices and menus.</p><h2>Report an issue</h2><p>If an ad obscures content or interrupts navigation, <a href="/contact/">tell us which page and device were affected</a>. Please avoid sending private browsing or account details.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
